    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search and find the holo-robo thanks to Finder's wifi antenna, in a evolutive map drawn entirely by hand!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/7127a07fba66356c78affd2029bd5f18.poster.avif?t=1747068116\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/7127a07fba66356c78affd2029bd5f18.webm?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/7127a07fba66356c78affd2029bd5f18.mp4?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the Robo before the ball escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/308f4c43093ccf634dc7d946016ae645.poster.avif?t=1747068116\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/308f4c43093ccf634dc7d946016ae645.webm?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/308f4c43093ccf634dc7d946016ae645.mp4?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scan &amp; build new Robo using &quot;bugZZ&quot;!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/6bbf7a8a0aa50e18da213da44c1e01f9.poster.avif?t=1747068116\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/6bbf7a8a0aa50e18da213da44c1e01f9.webm?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/6bbf7a8a0aa50e18da213da44c1e01f9.mp4?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick your &quot;Top 3&quot; and create your &quot;Team&quot; so you can hang out with them during your journey!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/81d0bebd8bbebc4f69557d5c6acb87cf.poster.avif?t=1747068116\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/81d0bebd8bbebc4f69557d5c6acb87cf.webm?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/81d0bebd8bbebc4f69557d5c6acb87cf.mp4?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 90 robots to find and collect, designed by comic book authors Valentin Seiche and Mortis Ghost (also creator of the game OFF), Pixel-Boy and AAA.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/7f703ba1286f6c916979ab89d6294461.avif?t=1747068116\" width=640 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A chill and cute ballad game, for the pleasure of discovering the nooks and crannies of a district that evolves over the course of the game and expanding your Robo collection!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/660467079fc2a48cab8462f27d1a0515.poster.avif?t=1747068116\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/660467079fc2a48cab8462f27d1a0515.webm?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/660467079fc2a48cab8462f27d1a0515.mp4?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search and find the holo-robo thanks to Finder's wifi antenna, in a evolutive map drawn entirely by hand!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/7127a07fba66356c78affd2029bd5f18.poster.avif?t=1747068116\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/7127a07fba66356c78affd2029bd5f18.webm?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/7127a07fba66356c78affd2029bd5f18.mp4?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the Robo before the ball escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/308f4c43093ccf634dc7d946016ae645.poster.avif?t=1747068116\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/308f4c43093ccf634dc7d946016ae645.webm?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/308f4c43093ccf634dc7d946016ae645.mp4?t=1747068116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scan &amp; build new Robo using &quot;bugZZ&quot;!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/6bbf7a8a0aa50e18da213da44c1e01f9.poster.avif?t=1747068